ntrol and consistency from the fairway or rough.</div></div></div></center><center><div><table><tbody><tr><td style=\"height:10px\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></center><center><div><table><tbody><tr><td style=\"height:10px\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></center><center><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src='data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVR42mP8/x8AAwMCAO+ip1sAAAAASUVORK5CYII=' data-src=\"https://gi.esmplus.com/epep5524/%ED%95%98%EB%8B%A8.png\"  style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\" /></div></center><span></span>",
  "text": "골프 웨지 봄베테크 - 프리미엄 세트 52 56 60도 스핀 증가를 위한 맥스 그루브 블랙\nBlack\nDescription\nThe Original BombTech wedge set includes a 52 Degree Gap Wedge, 56 Degree Sand Wedge and 60 Degree Lob Wedge.\nThe BombTech Wedges are slightly oversized to make even your bad shots look pretty freaking good.\nThe forgiving shape combined with heavier head weight gives you the feel and control that you would expect out of a premium set.\nStick it close and make your golf buddies jealous.\nGOODS SPECIFICS\n- Size : One Size\n- Color : Black\n- Golf Club Flex : Regular\n- Hand Orientation : Right\n- Golf Club Loft : 525 Degrees\n- Material : Alloy Steel\n- Brand : Bombtech Golf\n- Shaft Material : Stepped Steel\n- Item Weight : 1.45 Kilograms\n- Golf Putter Lie Angle : 60\n- Grip Material : Rubber\n- Grip Size : Standard\n- Grip Type : Rubber\n- UPC : 850064238167\n- Golf Club Type : Wedge Golf Club\n- Included Components : Golf Club\n- Manufacturer : Bombtech Golf\n- Item Package Dimensions L x W x H : 38 x 5 x 3 inches\n- Package Weight : 1.45 Kilograms\n- Brand Name : Bombtech Golf\n- Model Name : Bombtech 52, 56, 60 Wedge Set\n- Suggested Users : mens\n- Number of Items : 3\n- Sport Type : Golf\nFeature\n- PREMIUM QUALITY AT FRACTION OF THE PRICE: No retail and no pros means you get more for your money.\n- COMPLETE SET OF THREE WEDGES: Includes 52, 56 and 60 degree lofts with 12, 10 and 8 bounces.\n- MAX FORGIVENESS: Heavier weights for max control and feel provides for max forgiveness. The BombTech black golf wedges are slightly oversized to make even your bad shots look pretty freaking good.\n- OPTIMAL SPIN: Max legal groove depth for increased spin.\n- EASY TO HIT FROM ANYWHERE: Wedges that are easy to hit from anywhere. The micro-milled face provides for great spin, control and consistency from the fairway or rough.",
